tailwindcss-play-3.4.16.js is the Tailwind CSS Play CDN build of version 3.4.16 (https://cdn.tailwindcss.com/3.4.16),
copied here so the staff and customer pages never run a script fetched at run time from a third party (that CDN sends no
CORS headers, so Subresource Integrity cannot be used with it). sha384: mS5Uq7sE90lgbBDN8xgf34ibEgbZo4gB3tfLY40ZRle+M188BQw8onzNHg6GUZaA
